    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04e365b1bc84d828",
      "translationZh": "过去 11 天，我一直在训练一个用于类型化决策的小模型：支持工单分流、意图检测、内容审核、“智能体是否应该调用这个工具”之类的任务。你给它一些上下文和一个问题，它就会返回一个选项、一个分数，或一个是/否概率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "162200753af93e8b",
      "translationZh": "1.7B 参数（Qwen3-1.7B-Base + LoRA）。每个选项都在各自的分支中评分，因此选项的顺序无关紧要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8fe9eadd71bfcb4e",
      "translationZh": "在单张 RTX 4060 Ti 上，批大小为 1 时，短请求耗时约 16 ms，JevBench 测试项的耗时中位数约为 25 ms。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f0d1fc7c7df52d6",
      "translationZh": "JevBench 公开的 231 项：68.4%（Jev 86.6，Strands Decider 2B 72.3，自行报告，Laya 58.4）。DecideBench v1.1：75.5%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8722e75c69451507",
      "translationZh": "一次前向传播即可回答针对同一文本的多个问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
